{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-055.md","record_count":30,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...ராணி...அய்யா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி எங்கே?...நான் சமரசம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சமரசமா?...அய்யா, கேட்டீங்களா சேதியை...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என் குடும்பத்துக்கு களங்கம் வந்துடுச்சி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னது?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி மோசம்போயிட்டா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யா...என்ன சொல்றீங்க?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரோ ராசாவாம்...அவனோடே சேர்ந்து...மானமா வாழ்ந்த என் குடும்பத்திலே மாறாத அவமானத்தை உண்டாக்கிட்டா...என் கௌரவமெல்லாம் மண்ணோட மண்ணுப் போச்சு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ—ராணியே மண்ணாபோக பாக்கிறா! விஷம் சாப்பிட்டு சாகப்போறதா இதோ பாருங்க கடுதாசி எழுதி இருக்கு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! ராணி...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":73}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...ராணி...எங்க என் ராணி...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பெரியவரே! இனி உம்ம கதறல்...அந்த பொண்ணு காதிலே விழவே விழாது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ! இப்படியெல்லாம் வரும்னு தெரிஞ்சா உன் கல்யாணத்துக்கு சம்மதிச்சிருப்பேனே அம்மா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்ப சொல்லி என்ன பிரயோசனம்...? ஒண்ணும் பிரயோசனமில்லை...ம்...ஒப்பாரி வச்சு அழுவுறதுக்காகவே உயிரோடு இருக்கிறவங்களைக் கொல்றது...உலகத்துக்கே பழக்கமாப் போச்சே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...ராணி...அய்யா! ராணி எங்கே...? ராணி...ராணி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பதறாதே ராஜா...காரியம் எல்லாம் தீந்தது...உன் காதல் கைகூட முடியாத கனவாகவேப் பேச்சு!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யா! என்ன சொல்றீங்க? பெரியவரே, என் ராணி எங்கே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பெரியவரும் நீயும் சேர்ந்துதான்...ஒரு பெண்ணைப் பிணமாகவே ஆக்கிட்டீங்களே! சாவிலும், வாழ்விலும் பிரியமாட்டோம்னு சத்தியம்செய்யறது; சபதம் போடுறது; கடைசியிலே, கன்னிப் பெண்களை...இப்படி விஷம் சாப்பிட்டு சாக வைக்கிறது—காதல் ஒங்களுக்கு ஒரு கண்ணாமூச்சி விளையாட்டாப் போச்சு!...ம்...போ...போய் பாரு உன் காதலியை! போ!...போ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":74}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சமரசம் குரல்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பக்தா, பயப்படாதே! எழுந்திரு! ராணி உன் இஷ்டம்போல் சிறிது நேரம் உயிரோடிருந்து விட்டு பிறகு இறந்துபோக வரம் தந்தோம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க என்ன சொல்றீங்க? எனக்கொன்னும் புரியலியே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி எழுந்திரு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன, ராணி உயிரோடவா இருக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்! ஏன் திகைக்கிறீங்க?...இல்லே தெகப்பானேன்னு கேக்கிறேன்...ராணி உயிரோடதான் இருக்குது...சாகப்போன ராணியை நான் எப்படி காப்பாத்தினேன் தெரியும்ல...ராணி விஷத்தை எடுத்து சாப்பிடப் போச்சு...நல்ல வேளையா அந்த நேரத்திலே நான் வந்தேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...ராணி...என்ன இது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னை சாக விடுங்கள்...நான் இனிமேல் இந்த உலகத்தில் வாழ்ந்து பயனென்ன? நான் வாழ முடியாதவள்...வாழக் கூடாதவள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி, நான் வாழவைக்கிறேன். இந்தா பாரு! வாழ்க்கையிலே தோல்வியடைஞ்சவங்கெல்லாம்—தற்கொலை பண்ணிக்க ஆரம்பிச்சா...உலகத்திலே...முக்கால்வாசி ஜனத்தொகை எப்பவோ காலியா போயிருக்கும்...கவலைப்படாதே—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s055-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s055","scene_ordinal":55,"transition_audit_id":"T055","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! வேண்டாம், நான் சொல்றதைக்கேளு...கதவை தாப்பாபோட்டுட்டு விஷம் சாப்பிட்டுவிட்டு செத்தது மாதிரி படுத்துகிட. பாக்கியை நான் பாத்துக்கிறேன்...உம்...உடனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-055.md"}]}